-- Tool classification seeds for the capability-absorption native data vendors:
-- tikhub, strale, nasdaq.
--
-- These three are platform-funded 'internal'-tier vendors whose tools have
-- native/generated executors in connector-service. Classification came from
-- `classify:tools --connector <v> --from-registry` (no live customer
-- connection is needed — the tools are static registry entries), routed
-- through platform-backend's LLM relay. Until this seed existed each tool
-- fail-secured to write+sensitive+destructive, so every call needed HITL
-- approval: correct but over-gating. The three types are removed from
-- CLASSIFICATION_PENDING in src/__tests__/smoke/classification-coverage.test.ts
-- in the same change.
--
-- 533 tools: strale 334, tikhub 180, nasdaq 19. nasdaq is the market-data
-- surface (quotes, financials, earnings, dividends, filings, options,
-- screeners, movers, news) over nasdaq.com's public web API — NOT the retired
-- Data Link dataset API it used to wrap. Every one of the 533 is read-only
-- (empty categories) except 18 strale finance/compliance capabilities.
-- Over-classification would be fail-secure; there is none to correct here.
--
-- tool_classification_cache is UNIQUE on (tool_name, COALESCE(tenant_id,
-- '__global__')) and ToolClassifier.getCachedClassification matches on
-- tool_name ALONE — integration_type is provenance and is never filtered on.
-- All 533 names are distinct from each other AND from every name any prior
-- migration seeded (verified against the whole migrations tree), so no row
-- merges were needed. Had a name collided, the STRICTEST categories would
-- win — the union, never the looser side.
--
-- Numbered 436: 435 collided with 435_mcp_chat_runs_assistant_targets.sql,
-- which landed on origin/main while this was in flight. This file has never
-- been applied anywhere, so renaming it is safe. Never edit this file once
-- applied; fix forward with a new idempotent migration.

-- strale (334 tools)
ON CONFLICT (tool_name, COALESCE(tenant_id, '__global__')) DO UPDATE
  SET categories = EXCLUDED.categories,
      tool_description_hash = EXCLUDED.tool_description_hash,
      reviewed_by = EXCLUDED.reviewed_by,
      classified_at = NOW();

-- tikhub (180 tools)
ON CONFLICT (tool_name, COALESCE(tenant_id, '__global__')) DO UPDATE
  SET categories = EXCLUDED.categories,
      tool_description_hash = EXCLUDED.tool_description_hash,
      reviewed_by = EXCLUDED.reviewed_by,
      classified_at = NOW();

-- nasdaq (19 tools)
ON CONFLICT (tool_name, COALESCE(tenant_id, '__global__')) DO UPDATE
  SET categories = EXCLUDED.categories,
      tool_description_hash = EXCLUDED.tool_description_hash,
      reviewed_by = EXCLUDED.reviewed_by,
      classified_at = NOW();

